[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9963.15, "timestamp": "02:46:03", "text": "感觉就像，自从我开始……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9966.63, "timestamp": "02:46:06", "text": "V 型通道的多通道设计就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9970.07, "timestamp": "02:46:10", "text": "就像它是空的，它处于非活动状态一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9973.11, "timestamp": "02:46:13", "text": "我感觉很糟糕，因为我同时在进行多个应用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9975.19, "timestamp": "02:46:15", "text": "无需像我以前那样上传 Twitch WS。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9976.81, "timestamp": "02:46:16", "text": "事先要做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9978.55, "timestamp": "02:46:18", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9981.349, "timestamp": "02:46:21", "text": "然后短裤就出来了。然后大家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9983.51, "timestamp": "02:46:23", "text": "开始制作短视频内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9986.87, "timestamp": "02:46:26", "text": "他们创建了自己的频道。现在是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9989.59, "timestamp": "02:46:29", "text": "YouTube 在添加 Shorts 标签页之前就添加了 Shorts 标签页"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9992.07, "timestamp": "02:46:32", "text": "没有短标签。正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9994.71, "timestamp": "02:46:34", "text": "是的。正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9997.429, "timestamp": "02:46:37", "text": "所有那些东西。所以我就在想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10000.79, "timestamp": "02:46:40", "text": "从某种意义上说，YouTube 提供了更多功能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10003.75, "timestamp": "02:46:43", "text": "从那时起。所以我觉得就像在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10005.99, "timestamp": "02:46:45", "text": "未来他们会做得更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10008.95, "timestamp": "02:46:48", "text": "观众对观众的关注度更高"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10010.79, "timestamp": "02:46:50", "text": "经验。他们会把它做得更好。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10012.79, "timestamp": "02:46:52", "text": "感觉像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10015.23, "timestamp": "02:46:55", "text": "有可能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10018.469, "timestamp": "02:46:58", "text": "是的。太多事情了。"}]